---
---

<section class="relative py-24 bg-[#559A95] overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Decorative Shapes -->
  <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full overflow-hidden z-0 pointer-events-none">
    <div class="absolute top-[-10%] left-[-10%] w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-white/5 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-[-10%] right-[-10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-[#437A76]/40 rounded-full blur-3xl"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
      ¿Lista para priorizar tu bienestar?
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-white/90 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 font-light leading-relaxed">
      Dar el primer paso suele ser lo más difícil. Estoy aquí para acompañarte en un espacio seguro, profesional y libre de juicios.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-6">
      <a 
        href="/contacto" 
        class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-white text-[#559A95] rounded-full font-medium text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl"
      >
        Agendar Consulta
      </a>
      
      <!-- Si quisieras un segundo botón secundario -->
      <!-- <a 
        href="/servicios" 
        class="inline-block px-10 py-4 bg-transparent border border-white/60 text-white rounded-full font-medium text-lg hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-white transition-all duration-300"
      >
        Ver Servicios
      </a> -->
    </div>
    
    <div class="mt-12 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-white/70 text-sm tracking-wide uppercase">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#8CD6D1]"></span>
      <span>Presencial en Nicoya</span>
      <span class="mx-2">•</span>
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#8CD6D1]"></span>
      <span>Virtual a todo el mundo</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>